    <heroContent>
      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "blocks": {
    "contentData": [],
    "settingsData": [],
    "expose": [],
    "layout": {}
  },
  "markup": "\u003Cdiv class=\u0022control-header\u0022 aria-hidden=\u0022false\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022controls\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022umb-property-editor db\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022umb-property-editor umb-rte --initialized\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cdiv class=\u0022umb-rte-editor-con\u0022\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cstrong\u003EIf your work relies on asphalt testing, this comprehensive guide is for you.\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EIn this guide, we\u2019ll walk you through the full asphalt testing process \u2014 from sampling to strength analysis \u2014 so you know exactly what to expect and how testing ensures your project\u2019s success.\u003Cbr\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cem\u003EOn-Site Sampling\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Binder Content\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Bulk Density\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Marshall Stability\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Marshall Flow\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Gyratory Compaction\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Softening Point\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Elastic Recovery\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; Bitumen Viscosity\u0026nbsp; |\u0026nbsp; MMLS\u0026nbsp;\u003C/em\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003E\u0026nbsp;\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E\n\u003C/div\u003E"
}]]></Value>
    </heroContent>
